WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.700
If there is tape —

2
00:00:02.748 --> 00:00:05.980
keep the area dry until three days after surgery,

3
00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:07.660
and do not clean it before then.

4
00:00:07.953 --> 00:00:09.820
If there is no tape —

5
00:00:09.873 --> 00:00:13.740
clean the edges gently twice a day with equal parts hydrogen

6
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:17.820
peroxide and distilled water, then apply an antibiotic

7
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.900
ointment such as bacitracin.
